  "id": "root-policy-is-common-plus-orchestrator-part",
  "title": "Root policy is common plus orchestrator part",
  "requirement": "Every root agent reads the common working policy (Batch the work, Answering is not work, Report once), while the orchestrator-specific part (roles, delegation rules, the task ledger claim) is rendered only for the orchestrator preset; a delegated child gets only CHILD_POLICY.",
  "kind": "regression",
  "status": "verified",
  "source": "agent",
  "automated": true,
  "testPath": "plugins/orchestrator/test/policy-gating.test.mjs",
  "runCommand": "node --test plugins/orchestrator/test/policy-gating.test.mjs",
  "steps": [
    "apply the orchestrator plugin on a fake context and capture the policy section text for three agents",
    "a cordis root: assert the common markers are present and no orchestrator marker is",
    "an orchestrator root: assert both parts are present, common first",
    "a delegated child: assert the text is exactly CHILD_POLICY",
    "assert the module header no longer claims both 'applies to every preset' and 'every other root gets no section'"
  ],
  "expected": "The test exits 0; the pre-P5 sources fail every gating assertion and the negative control expect-pre-fix fails on the fixed files.",
